<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About — {{.SiteName}}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
    <script src="js/nav.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

    {{template "nav" .}}

    <main class="mission-page">
        <h1>About {{.SiteName}}</h1>
        <p>
            {{.SiteName}} is an independent advocacy resource connecting people with organizations
            working to end genital cutting and protect every child's right to bodily autonomy.
        </p>
        <p>
            We are not affiliated with any single organization. We amplify the work of those already
            engaged in this cause by making knowledge openly accessible and easier to act on by both parents and intactivists.
        </p>
    </main>

    {{template "footer" .}}

</body>
</html>
